    "Id": "chassisdef_nuwisha_NUW-X",
    "Name": "Nuwisha",
    "Details": "Not much is known about the Nuwisha X, but rumor says it carries some heavily experimental gear.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Self Repair</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.31</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
