  },
  "StockRole": "Sniper",
  "YangsThoughts": "Oh man Boss, this thing is a dream to work on. Those Coyote scientists included all the design schematics, ammunition formulas, everything to make the mech, in multiple redundant data storage spots located around the mech. The spacious room to do maintenance is something I haven't seen since an Orion, and I feel totally fine handing it over to the newbie mechtechs, because it's just so idiot proof (knock on wood).  They even engraved the wiring schematics into the mech's frame! Heck, I'd even let Darius try repairing it! Ok, no, I wouldn't, because somehow he'd find some hostile BA in a leg or something and we'd have a fight inside the Argo, but you know what I mean.",
